WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:12.400
Indoors, at a white wooden table with a flour mat and bowl, the cook forms cohesive dough.

2
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.930
The person kneads and folds the dough inside the wooden bowl.

3
00:00:25.596 --> 00:00:28.832
The cook kneads dough with a spatula in a white kitchen.

4
00:00:42.428 --> 00:00:47.246
The dough is pressed and folded, then lifted and turned to incorporate.

5
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:52.952
The cook cuts dough portions, shapes a ball, and rolls.

6
00:01:07.164 --> 00:01:09.785
The hands press dough gently into shape.

7
00:01:15.612 --> 00:01:17.274
Person shapes dough.

8
00:01:30.076 --> 00:01:32.687
Person creates snail shaped dough.

9
00:01:39.932 --> 00:01:41.936
Person covers dough balls.

10
00:01:45.596 --> 00:01:49.459
Person rolls small dough ball into thin round on flour mat.
